        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset LRLRDT, Ladera Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe contemporary design Ladera lever is clean and streamlined. It fits a whole range of decorating styles beautifully, from traditional ranch to modern contemporary just by selecting a different the finish. Easy to install, it will fit most pre-cut doors. The Ladera leverset is adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick doors with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". It is available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Ladera Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick SmartKey system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed lever.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Dual torque springs.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel strike.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Kwikset Ladera Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection Keyed Entry: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive lever for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational lever is for one side of the door. Visible installation screws on this function. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock on both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Half Dummy Function is handed. All other Functions are NON-Handed.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Kwikset Ladera Leverset",
                "description": "The contemporary design Kwikset Ladera lever is clean and streamlined. It fits a whole range of decorating styles beautifully, from traditional ranch to modern contemporary just by selecting a different the finish. Easy to install, it will fit most pre-cut doors. The Ladera Leverset is adjustable for 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed functions.",
                "keywords": "KWI-LRLRDT Kwikset Ladera Leverset, Kwikset Ladera Door Lever Sets, kwikset security series, kwi-488LRL half dummy levers, kwi-200LRL passage levers, kwi-300LRL privacy levers, kwi-405LRL keyed entry levers, residential door lever sets, Contemporary Design Ladera Lever, modern door levers, KWI-LRL levers,"
